      "answer": "$m=4$ at $(3,10)$; $m=-8$ at $(-3,22)$",
      "official_mark_scheme_text": "Equation of line is $y=mx-2$ — B1. OR.\n$x^2-2x+7=mx-2\\Rightarrow x^2-x(2+m)+9=0$ — M1.\nApply $b^2-4ac=0$: $(2+m)^2-4\\times9=0$ — *M1.\n$m=4$ or $-8$ — A1.\n$m=4\\Rightarrow x^2-6x+9=0\\Rightarrow x=3$; $m=-8\\Rightarrow x^2+6x+9=0\\Rightarrow x=-3$ — DM1.\n$(3,10),(-3,22)$ — A1A1.\nAlternative method: $\\frac{dy}{dx}=2x-2$ — B1; $2x-2=m$ — M1; $x^2-2x+7=(2x-2)x-2$ — M1; $x^2-9=0\\Rightarrow x=\\pm3$ — A1; $(3,10),(-3,22)$ — A1A1; when $x=3,m=4$, and when $x=-3,m=-8$ — A1.\nTotal: 7",
